Credits and third-party assets for "The Invisible Jacket"

Picture
- Drawn entirely in code. Crayon stroke engine, WebGL paper/wax/watercolour compositor and character rig helpers
  from Lemo-Opuscar, styles/crayon-book/demo (https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar; code MIT, content CC BY 4.0).
- Characters (Leo, the lady next door, deckchair, rabbit, tortoise, rubber duck), the page and the timeline were written for this film.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
- Gaegu (Regular, Bold), Copyright 2018 The Gaegu Project Authors, via @fontsource/gaegu 5.3.0.
- Patrick Hand (Regular), via @fontsource/patrick-hand 5.3.0.

Narration
- Kokoro text-to-speech, voice af_heart (Apache-2.0 model), offline.

Music (original composition for this film)
- Samples (CC0): FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org) — ukulele;
  VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios) — recorder/flute/clarinet/bassoon family;
  Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios) — glockenspiel, shaker.
- Music box, kalimba and pizzicato bass: physical modelling (Lemo-Opuscar core/audio/pluck.py). Toy piano: synthesised.

Sound effects
- All synthesised procedurally for this film (crayon on paper, wet brush, cloth, zip, gate, water, birds, crickets).

Tools
- ffmpeg 7.0.2 static build (LGPL/GPL), from the imageio-ffmpeg package.
